@startuml C3_Generate_Operation_Plans_Process_View
title C3 – Plan Generation (System Sequence)
hide footbox

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator
participant "OemOperationPlansComponent" as Component
participant "OemApiService" as Service
participant "OemProxyController" as Controller
participant "OemClient" as Client
participant "OEM Planning API" as OemApi
participant "Scheduling Engine" as Engine

== Preview ==
Operator -> Component : Request preview
Component -> Service : previewOperationPlans(payload)
Service -> Controller : POST /api/oem/operation-plans/preview
Controller -> Client : Forward payload
Client -> OemApi : POST /oem/operation-plans/preview
OemApi -> Engine : Execute algorithm (group operations per VVN)
Engine --> OemApi : Preview operations
OemApi --> Client : Preview array
Client --> Controller : 200 OK
Controller --> Service : OperationPlanPreviewDto[]
Service --> Component : Render preview grid

== Persist ==
Operator -> Component : Save generated plans
Component -> Service : generateOperationPlans(payload)
Service -> Controller : POST /api/oem/operation-plans/generate
Controller -> Client : Forward payload
Client -> OemApi : POST /oem/operation-plans/generate
OemApi -> Engine : Assign resources, compute metadata
Engine --> OemApi : Persisted plan ids + metadata
OemApi --> Client : Stored plans
Client --> Controller : 201 Created
Controller --> Service : OperationPlanDto[]
Service --> Component : Update saved list + toast
Component --> Operator : Show success and metadata

@enduml
